{
  "title": "German Pork Casserole",
  "description": "A rich and comforting German dish featuring tender pork and a crispy crust, perfect for a hangover cure. This recipe is made with shortening and render fat for a deliciously unctuous flavor.",
  "cuisine": "German",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
